  "body": "There is a really simple rust script here: https://github.com/erikjohnston/synapse-find-unreferenced-state-groups for finding unreferenced state groups. Unlike the compress state script there isn't really a reason for it to be in rust, and given a) its small and mostly just SQL and b) needs a lot of rework anyway, we may as well port it o Python and add it to Synapse.\r\n\r\nFor now it should just be a script that can run independently (though part of the synapse code), but we may wish to look into running it from within synapse later.  \r\n\r\nc.f. #3364 ",
